    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5c5f66",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1349081175,
      "version": 101,
      "versionNonce": 69963240,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787397932036,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "vAbSHGxC",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 1070,
      "height": 32.5,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "The token never reaches the Next.js server: it lives in localStorage and is attached in the browser. That keeps the credential off the\nserver, and it is also why every page that touches the API is a client component — server components cannot read localStorage.",
      "originalText": "The token never reaches the Next.js server: it lives in localStorage and is attached in the browser. That keeps the credential off the\nserver, and it is also why every page that touches the API is a client component — server components cannot read localStorage.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "x": 40,
      "y": 530
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#5c5f66",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3271357033,
      "version": 112,
      "versionNonce": 1833277416,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1787397942080,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "id": "fuZetcPk",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 1013.0859375,
      "height": 48.75,
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "Two independent processes, so both components of the origin contract have to agree: the browser must call the origin in\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL, and that origin must appear in CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS on the Django side. MySQL is reachable from the host on\n3307 for a GUI client, but the app container reaches it as app-db:3306.",
      "originalText": "Two independent processes, so both components of the origin contract have to agree: the browser must call the origin in\nNEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL, and that origin must appear in CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS on the Django side. MySQL is reachable from the host on\n3307 for a GUI client, but the app container reaches it as app-db:3306.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "x": 40,
      "y": 645
    }
